        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "10 months ago",
        "text": "Gilles Dumas was the electrician chosen by our contractor on our new construction. The consultation session on-site was quick and clear. During my walkthrough of the house following all the prewiring, everything was done perfectly. There was just 1 electrical outlet and 1 internet outlet that had been installed in the wrong place. I sent a message to advise them of this and they responded quickly and handled the situation very professionally. We appreciate everything they did for our new home!",
        "time": 1743175394,
